# ── /data: ignore EVERYTHING, opt back in explicitly ────────────────────────
# Use `data/**` + `!` negations — NOT a bare `data/` dir-ignore. Git cannot
# re-include a child of an excluded directory, so `data/` + `!data/keep` is a
# no-op; `data/**` keeps the parent eligible for negation.
data/**
# Tracked exceptions (small, genuinely versioned):
!data/scrape50_config.yaml
!data/gold_labeling_20260907.csv
# To track anything else under /data, add `!data/<path>` here — and remember
# every DB/backup/media file under /data is derived or operational state.
# Root tidiness (2026-09-15): backups -> data/backups/, logs -> data/logs/.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.env
.gcs-service-account.json
*.gcs-service-account.json

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
dagster_home/
.ruff_cache/
.pytest_cache/
*.log
*.egg-info/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
*.db
tasks/*
!tasks/epics/
data/backups/
data/_tmp_*/
scripts/_diag_*
scripts/pilot_*

data/dev/
